<main class="community-page" style="--accent: <%= current_site.accent_color %>">
  <header class="community-header"><%= link_to current_site.name, community_path, class: "brand" %><%= link_to "Management", management_path %></header>
  <section class="feed-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Preserved history</p><h1>Archive snapshots</h1><p>Each freeze captures an immutable versioned manifest and a standalone readable HTML record. Public-safe exports exclude passwords, session data, invitation codes, guest contact details, member-only posts, Couple Inbox conversations, private groups, and invite-only events. Back up the database and Active Storage volume alongside it to preserve original media files.</p><% @snapshots.each do |snapshot| %><article class="post-card"><h2>Frozen <%= snapshot.frozen_at.to_fs(:long) %></h2><p>By <%= snapshot.created_by.display_name %> · checksum <code><%= snapshot.checksum %></code></p><p><%= snapshot.content_counts.map { |name, count| "#{count} #{name.humanize.downcase}" }.to_sentence %></p><div class="actions"><%= link_to "Public-safe JSON", export_archive_snapshot_path(snapshot), class: "button button-secondary" %><%= link_to "Public-safe HTML", readable_export_archive_snapshot_path(snapshot), class: "button button-secondary" %><%= link_to "Complete JSON", export_archive_snapshot_path(snapshot, include_private: 1), class: "button button-secondary" %><%= link_to "Complete HTML", readable_export_archive_snapshot_path(snapshot, include_private: 1), class: "button button-secondary" %></div></article><% end %><% if @snapshots.empty? %><p>No snapshot yet. Set the community state to Frozen from Management to create the first one.</p><% end %></section>
</main>
